["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"34. 被忽視的中腰部公司活得還好嗎？他們的慾望、掙扎與天命 Permanent Head Damage BAU cut off\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-07-31-zhangxiaojun-中腰部公司不是小公司-是二级赛道里被忽视的王者/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3ab22b27de95a023-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0731</span></div>\n<h2>中腰部公司不是小公司，是二級賽道里被忽視的王者</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">它們大多是一個千億級二級賽道里的第一或第二名，創始人從不甘心只做中腰部，但賽道出身極大程度上決定了它們的天花板。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中腰部公司</span><span class=\"tag\">二級賽道</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"33.【職場人性】企業內鬥，究竟在鬥什麼？ Silo OGSM integrity organizational awareness resourceful\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-07-19-zhangxiaojun-内斗是显性的-内耗才是组织的慢性自杀/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/82ee0734b369d003-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:08:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0719</span></div>\n<h2>內鬥是顯性的，內耗才是組織的慢性自殺</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">內鬥看得見、還能吃瓜，內耗看不見、卻被當成制度流程本身；真正拖垮公司的不是誰跟誰鬥，而是資源冗餘、方向缺失下人人追求存在感。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">組織管理</span><span class=\"tag\">職場</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"32. 第一個把查理·芒格引入中國的人和出版風雲 咖啡書 馬爾薩斯陷阱 雙軌分析 系統一\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-07-10-zhangxiaojun-把芒格引入中国的人-出版黄金十年已经落幕/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1f1e5f8dcbbb78e3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:13:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0710</span></div>\n<h2>把芒格引入中國的人：出版黃金十年已經落幕</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">出版業沒有定價權，京東把圖書當引流品虧著賣，行業幾百億規模在它眼裡只是廣告費。施宏俊說出版會變成邊緣行業，但也會變得更「高貴」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出版</span><span class=\"tag\">芒格</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"31.【趨勢2023】和老範從退潮的內容投資談起 carry BP MR NFT\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-07-03-zhangxiaojun-投资人不再投纯内容-因为内容是马鞍不是千里马/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9608565a6d569392-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0703</span></div>\n<h2>投資人不再投純內容，因為內容是馬鞍不是千里馬</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">內容公司成功率遠高於絕大多數生意，但天花板由產業特質決定：百花齊放意味著集中度低。所以投資人把內容當鞭子，去找能騎的千里馬。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">內容投資</span><span class=\"tag\">播客</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"29. 逆全球化思潮來勢洶洶，外企CEO何故密集訪華？ CDR 紅籌架構 FDI 國際版\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-06-12-zhangxiaojun-外企ceo密集访华-逆全球化是政治问题-不是经济问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bb0b83ff98bdb00e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">50:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0612</span></div>\n<h2>外企CEO密集訪華：逆全球化是政治問題，不是經濟問題</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">逆全球化來勢洶洶卻擋不住CEO們排隊來華，因為脫鉤違反經濟規律；但真正推動脫鉤的不是經濟邏輯，而是老大防老二的政治邏輯。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中美關係</span><span class=\"tag\">外資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"26. 令德國人驚嚇的上海車展：一幅當代汽車眾生圖 just in time OTA For China For China\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-05-23-zhangxiaojun-车展最热闹的一年-也是合资品牌最危险的一年/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ec1dcb3e2905617e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0523</span></div>\n<h2>車展最熱鬧的一年，也是合資品牌最危險的一年</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中國品牌市佔率會很快提高，合資品牌若不能給合資公司帶來價值，就可能變成獨資品牌——這是車展熱鬧背後真正的洗牌。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">汽車</span><span class=\"tag\">上海車展</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"25. OpenAI開源、亞馬遜新動作，全球大模型格局走向何方 vertical copilot LLM transformer\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-05-16-zhangxiaojun-大模型底层战争已结束-垂直副驾驶才是老炮的机会/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8ffbd8664f0cee8a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">55:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0516</span></div>\n<h2>大模型底層戰爭已結束，垂直副駕駛才是老炮的機會</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">底層大模型是年輕人借微軟算力做出的湧現，但真正賺錢的行業副駕駛屬於創業老兵——三分之二的垂直機會已被ChatGPT自己幹掉，剩下的是數據、社交和商業模式的組合戰。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">垂直副駕駛</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"24.【趨勢2023】從北森IPO看充滿挑戰的中國企服這兩年 PS NDR PMF fine tune pre-chain\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-05-12-zhangxiaojun-企服公司2025年上市潮-先做后说-ps回到10倍以下/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8dd48df98352813c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:14:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0512</span></div>\n<h2>企服公司2025年上市潮：先做後說，PS回到10倍以下</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">過去兩三年整個企業服務市場被高估了50%到100%，PS從三四十倍回落到十倍以下。北森IPO是「丐版IPO」，但它是中國SaaS系統性上市的第一槍，2025年將有一波企服上市潮。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企業服務</span><span class=\"tag\">SaaS</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"22. 要做中國OpenAI？李志飛勸各位同仁冷靜點 self-supervised in-context learning AGI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-04-16-zhangxiaojun-李志飞劝退通用大模型-中国不会有第二个-openai/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0bbf2eb9a18261c6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:08:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0416</span></div>\n<h2>李志飛勸退通用大模型：中國不會有第二個 OpenAI</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他一個月前說要當中國 OpenAI，現在說這個命題大概率不存在——因為共識達成太快、難度被開源和算力迅速拉低，而 OpenAI 自己能不能從商業上笑到最後都不好說。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">創業</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"21. 投資人視角下的大模型和市場真實水溫｜和夢秋聊ChatGPT Killing App Prompt Engineering COT Fine tuning Middle layer\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-04-08-zhangxiaojun-大模型是大厂的菜-创业公司别走-jasper-的老路/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dff80d1dde94dc31-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0408</span></div>\n<h2>大模型是大廠的菜，創業公司別走 Jasper 的老路</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大模型不是搜索引擎的替代品而是補充，真正的機會在醫療、材料這類大模型抓不到數據的垂直領域，而通用大模型本身只屬於巨頭。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">一級市場</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"20. The Information前記者空降巴西，她的拉美商業遊記 warm intro growth VC fund Rappi Mafia The Edge of Democracy\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-03-21-zhangxiaojun-巴西像七八年前的中国-但中间公司活不下来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/23388c61192213d1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">52:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0321</span></div>\n<h2>巴西像七八年前的中國，但中間公司活不下來</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">巴西的稅收和勞工法讓大公司和小團隊都能活，唯獨中間規模的公司被夾死；政治左右搖擺本身是確定的，創業者把它當成可控制的變量。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出海</span><span class=\"tag\">拉美</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"19. 硅谷銀行危機未結束：未來風險傳導的3個可能 FDIC MBS beginning of the end end of the beginning\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-03-15-zhangxiaojun-硅谷银行倒闭-美联储只保存款人-不保股东/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/46b66f8e0ad7b880-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">36:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0315</span></div>\n<h2>硅谷銀行倒閉：美聯儲只保存款人，不保股東</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美聯儲做了一個黑白分明的決定：三萬戶機構存款人全額保護，股東血本無歸。這不是雷曼時刻，而是一個時間差——但美國信譽的慢性下滑可能才剛開始。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">硅谷銀行</span><span class=\"tag\">美聯儲</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"18. 商業口述史：從美國往事，到Google輸掉OpenAI第一局 money follows eyeball Transformer Alphabet\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-03-14-zhangxiaojun-雅虎当年拒绝收购谷歌-因为不信搜索能做大/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b956cb3f645c5229-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0314</span></div>\n<h2>雅虎當年拒絕收購谷歌，因為不信搜索能做大</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">雅虎和寶潔都犯過同一個錯：不相信搜索會走到前臺、不相信美國人會坐在街邊喝星巴克。創始人過早退到二線，公司就失去了賭一把的能力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">商業口述史</span><span class=\"tag\">谷歌</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"17.【趨勢2023】沉悶的港股會好嗎、富豪的家辦與苦惱 Family Office Trustee Boy Leverage Insurance PI客戶 Long Only\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-03-03-zhangxiaojun-家族办公室比家族还多-香港的财富管理时代才刚开始/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a527783c09130bf7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:13:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0303</span></div>\n<h2>家族辦公室比家族還多，香港的財富管理時代才剛開始</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">港股從14000點反彈50%只是情緒修復，真正的新趨勢是香港從Fintech轉向Wealth Management——但家辦門檻低到沒有牌照要求，魚龍混雜。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">港股</span><span class=\"tag\">家族辦公室</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"16.【趨勢2023】那些掙到錢、消失的互聯網中高層去哪了 Individual Contributor stakeholder social listening vintage\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-02-16-zhangxiaojun-互联网中高层出走率接近三分之二-但这不是年龄问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bd9c22e61c238c2f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0216</span></div>\n<h2>互聯網中高層出走率接近三分之二，但這不是年齡問題</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">互聯網二十年高增長靠技術紅利和用戶紅利，紅利掩蓋了管理能力的缺失；今天組織膨脹變成內耗，出走是行業自我校正，而不是35歲危機。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">互聯網</span><span class=\"tag\">職業經理人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"14. 香港的語言政策、曖昧和青年迷思 兩文三語 微調教學語言 吳慶瑞報告書 特選學校 Burlister liberal studies\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-01-31-zhangxiaojun-香港两文三语只有3-到5-的人能做到-这是个失败的政策/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/21c3ed4be09c6fe3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0131</span></div>\n<h2>香港兩文三語只有3%到5%的人能做到，這是個失敗的政策</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">香港堅持一個只有3%到5%的人能達到的語言政策目標，而新加坡用50年、三代人完成了從雙語並重到英文為主的轉向，代價是消滅方言和壓制反對派。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">香港</span><span class=\"tag\">語言政策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"13. 郵輪小史，去尋找海面上的烏托邦 White Star old money freestyle godmother\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-01-20-zhangxiaojun-邮轮巨头靠并购做大-为造船收购船厂的那家破产了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/36d7711868e85f95-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0120</span></div>\n<h2>郵輪巨頭靠併購做大，為造船收購船廠的那家破產了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">嘉年華幾十年裡把白星、冠達這些老牌公司一家家買下來，最多時手上約100條船；雲頂為了造20萬噸巨輪去收購德國船廠，資金被套在裡面，最後破產。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">郵輪</span><span class=\"tag\">旅遊業</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"12. 和黃宇翔聊東南亞另5國：小國的扈從和對沖 hedging multi-directional reconciliation The Art of Not Being Governed\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-01-16-zhangxiaojun-小国不站队-东南亚五国的对冲术/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ccaf62c904030e05-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0116</span></div>\n<h2>小國不站隊：東南亞五國的對沖術</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">緬甸、老撾、柬埔寨、文萊、東帝汶這五個小國，很少一邊倒，而是農業靠一家、國防靠另一家，用多向量外交在大國之間做對沖。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">東南亞</span><span class=\"tag\">地緣政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"11. 新加坡的淘金熱和政商環境 Token2049 Terra FTX 淡馬錫 沙盒\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-01-09-zhangxiaojun-新加坡不是-web3-中心-只是全球淘金者的避难所/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/69d6c01b93fc11e5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0109</span></div>\n<h2>新加坡不是 Web3 中心，只是全球淘金者的避難所</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">新加坡政府從 2010 年就給官員發比特幣做實驗，但它體量太小、技術人員太少，註定只能當樞紐而非中心。真正值錢的是它用企業方式運作政府、給創業公司報銷 70% 參展費的那套機制。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">新加坡</span><span class=\"tag\">Web3</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"6. 顯微鏡下的硅谷大裁員：一筆筆現實經濟賬 Level.FYI Cobra H1B P&amp;L IC\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-11-21-zhangxiaojun-meta-裁员补偿-4-n-2-有绿卡是幸福-没绿卡是倒计时/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/32e62e38accb0559-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">33:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1121</span></div>\n<h2>Meta 裁員補償 4+N/2：有綠卡是幸福，沒綠卡是倒計時</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">同一場 Meta 裁員，有綠卡的人拿著十幾萬美金去新公司上班，沒綠卡的人要在四個月內、還是節假日窗口裡找到下一份工作，否則就得離開美國。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">硅谷裁員</span><span class=\"tag\">Meta</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"3. 宇航員與機器人：漫談深邃浪漫的ROBOT新知 in-hand manipulation DARPA Robotic Challenge silver bullet product market fit DLR\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-10-10-zhangxiaojun-让机器人削个土豆就能当院士-这比登火星更难/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bd4230dec43e1a9d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">58:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1010</span></div>\n<h2>讓機器人削個土豆就能當院士，這比登火星更難</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">登火星的技術人類大部分已經有了，只是個經濟問題；但怎麼讓機器人在廚房裡工作，人類現在還不知道，甚至還沒有思路——誰能讓機器人削個土豆，可以當院士。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">機器人</span><span class=\"tag\">人形機器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"2. 和曹巍聊聊馬斯克、機器人恐怖谷和《西部世界》 uncanny valley iToF SLAM 力控\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-10-03-zhangxiaojun-人形机器人最难的环节不是走路-是穿针剥虾/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2834a742a2c9e6e4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">55:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1003</span></div>\n<h2>人形機器人最難的環節不是走路，是穿針剝蝦</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">雙足行走和自主導航都能沿襲特斯拉自動駕駛的積累，精準力控和觸覺不能——那要模擬人的皮膚，開車時根本用不到。第一版、第二版機器人大概只到人的 20% 到 30%。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人形機器人</span><span class=\"tag\">特斯拉</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"1. 和投資人夢秋聊聊加州、投資寒潮和林黛玉 Bubble Burst 持幣待購\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-07-11-zhangxiaojun-资本寒冬不是缺钱-是大家都在持币待购/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8e3f2f9d0bed1e26-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">54:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0711</span></div>\n<h2>資本寒冬不是缺錢，是大家都在持幣待購</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">「資本寒冬」每兩三年就被喊一次，通常六到八個月就過去。這次不一樣：兩頭在外的美元通路被打斷，不是沒錢，而是不知道該怎麼投。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">一級市場</span><span class=\"tag\">資本寒冬</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"串臺《硅谷101》｜TikTok如何在Facebook眼皮底下成長起來？ UP 值 UG 中臺 Lasso\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-05-16-zhangxiaojun-tiktok-在-facebook-眼皮底下长大-靠的不是产品而是体系/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/83f0cc536109ca7b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">38:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0516</span></div>\n<h2>TikTok 在 Facebook 眼皮底下長大，靠的不是產品而是體系</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">字節贏在體系而非個人：推薦算法、UG 中臺、商業化三套系統疊加 Musical.ly 的產品殼，再用對標 Facebook 的 UP 值打法下狠手投放，才跑出全球第五大社交應用。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出海</span><span class=\"tag\">TikTok</span>\n</div></div></a>"]